<title>PHILIPPINES: First Holdings 95/96 net at 1.293 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>First Holdings 95/96 net at 1.293 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ending June 30</p>
<p>(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>Earnings per share (pesos)  5.798 vs 2.851</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	    3.003 vs 2.149</p>
<p>    Net income			1,293 vs 573</p>
<p>Note: Full name First Philippine Holdings Corp. Figures are audited.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
